**Path**: {{ if .IsToolsMode }}~/.claude/dev-verify-docs{{ else }}.claude/docs{{ end }}/PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md
**Read when**: Creating new files, deciding where each file goes
**Reglas criticas**:
1. Domain/ and Data/ are GLOBAL layers (not inside Features/)
2. Features/ contains ONLY presentation: DI, UI, Presentation, Navigation
3. Core/ contains shared infrastructure: DesignSystem, Networking, Persistence, Common
4. MUST follow exact folder hierarchy per feature

